# Java / Spring standards

- Domain packages: `domain/`, `application/`, `adapter/in/{web,messaging}/`, `adapter/out/{persistence,client,messaging}/`.
- Controllers stay in `adapter.in.web` (never name package `api` inside domains — clashes with `apps/api`).
- `domains/*` may depend only on `platform/*`. No domain→domain compile deps; use outbox events.
- `platform/*` must never depend on `domains/*`.
- Prefer package-private domain types. No business logic in `apps/*`.
- Validate at trust boundaries (`adapter.in.*`); keep `@Transactional` on application services, not controllers.
- Map epic → module via `docs/architecture/MODULE_MAP.md` before adding packages.
